            "text": "XSS / reflected input injection via JSON-RPC id and unknown-tool echo — No issue identified: mcp.php JSON-RPC response echo (mcp_result/mcp_error)\n\n$payload['id'] and unknown-tool names echo verbatim into JSON responses (mcp.php:35-41, 149), but all responses flow through json_out() (bootstrap.php:21-29) with Content-Type application/json; charset=utf-8 + X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff + Cache-Control: no-store and json_encode — harness-replicated echo of <img src=x onerror=alert(1)> id + <script>alert(2)</script> tool name arrives as JSON strings, inert. nginx adds nosniff + X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN globally (landing.conf:193-195). Post-auth reflection probes blocked pre-auth (proxy ids 91/92 returned 401); harness-verified echo path. No XSS vector."
