          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "CSRF (token single-use / session-bound / timing-safe / cross-site forgeability) — No issue identified: POST /api/disconnect.php\n\nCSRF forgery blocked by hash_equals() compare of a 128-bit random token bound to the victim session (php/bootstrap.php:44-49), SameSite=Lax session cookie (bootstrap.php:8-16), and POST-only enforcement. Probes: valid token via header -> 200 (x3, token non-rotating but replay requires knowing it); attacker token + victim cookie -> 403; empty header -> 403; no cookie + no token -> 403; GET -> 405. No Origin/Referer check exists (residual defense-in-depth gap, noted)."
          },
          "locations": [
